<title>USA: Golden Quail in deal with gold mine firms.</title>
<headline>Golden Quail in deal with gold mine firms.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Quail Resources Ltd Thursday said it signed a letter of intent with Atkinson Construction of San Francisco, and  Zachry Construction of San Antonio to mine and process the ore at its gold mine located in San Bernardino, Calif. subject to permit completion.</p>
<p>Reserves on the project currently exceed $70 million in market value. Golden Quail owns 75.3 percent of the project.</p>
